including by pursuing “general AI” that can act autonomously in novel circumstances. Open-source research      
identifies 30 Chinese institutions engaged in one or more of this project‘s aspects, including machine         
learning, brain-inspired AI, and brain-computer interfaces. This report previews a CSET pilot program that will
track China’s progress and provide timely alerts.}                                                             
